# Ignore in all directories
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
**/prompts_master.md

# Terraform
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.backup
**/terraform.tfstate.*.backup

# Terraform credentials (SECURITY: Never commit real credentials)
