# Environment files (but NOT terraform.tfvars which contains necessary config)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.development
**/.env.test
**/.env.production
**/.env.example  

# other dependencies
**/.pnp
**.pnp.js

# testing
**/coverage

# production
**/build
**/dist

# logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# IDE
.idea
.vscode

